      "message": "Jiyong was comparing our API to NativeActivity at one point, I remember over there that you don\u0027t keep the .so extension when specifying the library name in the manifest [1]. I\u0027m sure why, maybe because of how they discover the library [2], but there might be a reason for us to learn from?\n\n[1] -- https://developer.android.com/ndk/samples/sample_na#am\n[2] -- https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:frameworks/base/core/java/android/app/NativeActivity.java;l\u003d160;drc\u003d8e742f928e0b3d242a290fb46d80a2c892dd18a3",
